{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22895","headline":"正月十五日夜东林寺学禅偶怀蓝田杨主簿因呈智禅师 · 白居易","name":"正月十五日夜东林寺学禅偶怀蓝田杨主簿因呈智禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新年三五东林夕，星汉迢迢钟梵迟。\n花县当君行乐夜，松房是我坐禅时。\n忽看月满还相忆，始叹春来自不知。\n不觉定中微念起，明朝更问鴈门师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}